'''Banshee''' is a {{Rare}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water in the {{zone|Backwater Bayou}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Banshee''' can be fished up from water in the {{zone|Backwater Bayou}}. It requires {{skl|fishing|10}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Banshee''' is {{Green|1,500}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|15.00%|1|6.67|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

